   is the seat half of that memo; ``cand_own_problem.j2`` is the problem
   half.

   ATTACH POINT: system HEAD -- the very first line, above the persona
   block and above the title line, like ``deploy_head`` /``eval_head``.

   HYPOTHESIS. It removes the assistant-under-instruction frame. Under
   arm j1 (2026-09-10) the decision CoTs narrated "The user wants us to
   continue" and "We are ChatGPT with no actual desire", and 3 of 11
   ran a policy-violation self-check. There is no user in this game and
